### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=&orderBy=name&orderType=desc&page=1&perPage=4
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/581c32ef-7650-4554-837a-9e07c41e4a39
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Delete category by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/83dc6895-4f59-4670-9227-4f7e0b84c84a
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Create new category
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}

